From 24680c9fceb6494d035c720c7ef69a44fb5c3f47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:37:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Tab spacing, dark-mode OSD, theme colour wheel

- Tabs on every page get room around them (padding 4x10 px, 10 px apart)
  instead of running into each other.
- The volume/Bluetooth OSD now looks like Dash's dialogs in each mode and
  follows mode changes. It drew palette(window), which Dash leaves light,
  so in dark mode it was a light panel with white text and icons.
- Settings > Main > Color opens a colour wheel (the lighting plugins' wheel)
  with a brightness slider and preview, instead of red/green/blue sliders.
- The on-screen keyboard's backspace key reads "del": the font has no
  backspace symbol.
